OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir 'half full' after hot,
OL,4,Adry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reservoir is just over half full
OL,7,Ffollowing a "prolonged" period of hot
OL,8,Fand dry weather.
OL,10,FHanningfield Reservoir, between
OL,11,FChelmsford and Wickford is just 52%
OL,12,Ffull according to operators Essex and
OL,13,FSuffolk Water (ESW), who said they do
OL,14,Fnot expect significant rainfall until
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FIn August, the firm implemented its
OL,18,Ffirst hosepipe ban in almost 30 years,
OL,19,Fdescribing the situation as "very
OL,20,Funusual".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
