OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir 'half full' after hot,
OL,4,Adry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FESW, which also owns Abberton
OL,7,FReservoir, said their total water
OL,8,Fsupply has dropped by a quarter since
OL,9,FJune, from 83% to 57%.
